@startuml sd06_last_report
!include ../style.iuml
autonumber

actor Programmer as P
participant "Main window\n(QML)" as QML
participant "LastReportDialog\n(QML)" as Report
participant "TrackControllerState" as State
participant "views" as Views
participant "RowsModel\n(report)" as Rows

note over State, Rows
  On every refresh(): _fill_tables(wayside)
  → self._report.set_rows(views.report_rows(wayside))
end note
P -> QML : **View** on the CTC uplink strip
QML -> Report : open()
Report -> State : reportReadyText (property)
State --> Report : "Ready" if report.ready\nelse f"Not ready: {report.reason}"
Report -> State : report (property)
State --> Report : RowsModel
Report -> Rows : rowCount(); data(index, role)
Rows --> Report : one row per block: occupied,\nswitch_position, signal_aspect,\ncrossing_active
Report --> P : every block as the CTC Office received it
P -> Report : **Close**
Report -> Report : close()
@enduml
